st reliable banks and housing finance companies (HFCs), providing a seamless and secure home loan experience.\n\n## About Sahakar Avenue\n\nSahakar Avenue is a residential project located in Malad West, Mumbai, developed by the Sahakar Corporation, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1.5 & 2 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 15,200. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1.5 BHK is 595... Read More\n\nSahakar Avenue is a residential project located in Malad West, Mumbai, developed by the Sahakar Corporation, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1.5 & 2 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 15,200. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1.5 BHK is 595 sqft. The area of 2 BHK are in the range of 661 - 764 sqft. A 1.5 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 90.2 lakhs. A 2 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 1 Crs.\n\nThe prime location of Sahakar Avenue is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Malad West, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Sahakar Avenue is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Sahakar Avenue\n\n* About Locality\n* Investments\n\nMalad (West) in Mumbai is a well-developed locality with a variety of resources available at a stone€™s throw away. Connectivity is extremely effortless thanks to the New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Western Express Highway & Malad Railway Station.\n\nThere are numerous healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes that are in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities:**\n\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Ahura Maternity & Nursing Home\n* Thunga Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions:**\n\n* Pinnacle High International School\n* Orchids The International School\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n* Infinity Mall\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Oberoi Mall\n\nLocated in the heart of Mumbai, Malad has slowly emerged as a popular real estate destination. Due to its very good connectivity, and incredible infrastructure, it has become a lucrative place for real estate investments. Thanks to the continuous infrastructure development, Malad is transforming into an urban locality, suitable for residents in today€™s day and age. Owing to the present infrastructure growth, the area€™s connectivity will enhance even further, thereby making Malad the perfect destination for real estate developments. Additionally, the growth of many posh and upmarket residential as well as commercial projects in the location suggests that the prices of real estate investments will continue to have an upward trajectory.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/657fece93fbc0da68da0ae84/7da31f2f-588a-4da9-9b35-5a8175567b20_Screenshot2023-12-18122747.png)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n\n[![Sandhya Charkop Jeevan Mangal-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/646def1ada245958afa7cedf/c4c7f3c9-bbb9-4f3b-95c1-9b6a2a3bd908_elevationmangal.png)\n\n